                "caption": "Figure 5:Overview of VideoNexus.The planner calls perception tools through MCP; each tool processes native media in an independent context and returns a compact report on the absolute source timeline. Thick arrows carry video and audio into perception; coral arrows carry reports back, optionally accompanied by evidence cards of at most six frames. Bottom: the Finding schema and validation. Dashed tools are optional; crops are used on both benchmarks, while web search and extraction are used only on Video-GAIA.",
